<title>CANADA: TABLE - Canada June petroleum product sales rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Canada June petroleum product sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Canada on Friday issued the following  data for sales of refined petroleum products:</p>
<p>PETROLEUM PRODUCT SALES (thousands of cubic meters)</p>
<p>				    June 1997    June 1996	pct</p>
<p>   Total sales		  7,491.3	7,106.1	 +5.4</p>
<p>   Motor gasoline	     3,108.8	2,988.8	 +3.7</p>
<p>   Diesel fuel		  1,793.4	1,643.1	 +9.1</p>
<p>   Light fuel oil		 187.1	  211.5	-11.5</p>
<p>   Heavy fuel oil		 512.6	  463.3	+10.6</p>
<p>   Aviation turbo fuels	 509.6	  520.2	 -2.0</p>
<p>   Petrochemical feedstocks   372.4	  357.2	 +4.3</p>
<p>   All other products	 1,007.4	  912.0	+10.5</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact David Roeske,  Energy Section, (613) 951-3563.)</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau (613) 235-6745))</p>
</text>
